  id: spell-mage-hand
  displayName: Mage Hand
  description: A spectral, floating hand appears at a point you choose within range and lasts for 1 minute. You can use your action to move it up to 30 feet and manipulate objects, open unlocked doors/containers, stow/retrieve items, or pour a container's contents. It can't attack, activate magic items, or carry more than 10 pounds. Pure utility -- no mechanical effect authored.
